  <data name="CertificateGuideStep3Suffix.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>，然后点击下一步。</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep4Prefix.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>4. 如果 Windows 询问是否允许更改，点击 </value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep4Action.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>是</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep4Suffix.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>。</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep5Prefix.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>5. 选择 </value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep5StoreMode.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>将所有的证书都放入下列存储</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep5Middle.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>，再点击 </value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep5Browse.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>浏览...</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep5Suffix.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>。</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep6Prefix.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>6. 在列表中选择 </value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep6Store.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>受信任人</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep6Middle.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>，点击确定，然后点击 </value></data>
